  "body": "# Release Notes\r\n\r\n## Major Changes\r\n\r\n### AI Computing\r\n\r\nThis release introduces AI Computing, enabling your DePIN node to receive AI tasks from the network and execute them locally. Once enabled, the node will automatically fetch assigned workloads, run them on available resources, and report results back to the coordinator—unlocking a new earning and utility path for node operators.\r\n\r\n### Auto Update (Experimental)\r\n\r\nWe’re also shipping Auto Update (Experimental) for the DePIN runner. When enabled, the runner can update itself while running to deliver faster fixes and improvements with minimal downtime. This feature is still experimental, so behavior may vary across environments—use it if you’re comfortable testing early-stage updates in production-like setups.\r\n"
